# Knoema Engine
Open runtime for persistent NPCs, synthetic replay research, and reproducible agent simulation.

## Triple-use narrative
Pedagogical criminology: fictional, non-identifying replay overlays for classroom safety discussions.
Reproducibility research: seed-fixed configs, logs, and benchmark artifacts for auditable agent studies.
Game-studio demo: persistent-memory NPC runtime with adapters, replay viewer, and voice playback surface.

